# Compiled Go binaries. `go build` with no -o drops one named after the
# package directory next to the source, and `smokeclient` reached the repo
# that way: 12 MB of Mach-O, larger than the whole rest of the history.
# Everything that uses it runs `go run ./internal/testsupport/smokeclient`.
